1
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:03,700
(Leonard:)We're not selling
his tomatoes on eBay.

2
00:00:03,697 --> 00:00:07,697
(Raj:)No, if we got Captain Reynolds
from Firefly

3
00:00:07,701 --> 00:00:10,031
(Raj:)to do a signing
at Stuart's store,

4
00:00:10,036 --> 00:00:11,466
(Howard:)that would be
amazing.

5
00:00:11,471 --> 00:00:12,801
(Howard:)That would be great.

6
00:00:12,806 --> 00:00:14,576
(Raj:)So should we go
talk to him?

7
00:00:14,574 --> 00:00:15,974
(Penny:)I don't know.

8
00:00:15,975 --> 00:00:18,645
(Leonard:)I mean, if he's not nice,
it's gonna make it hard for me

9
00:00:18,645 --> 00:00:20,875
(Leonard:)to watch him in
anything again.
What?!

10
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,880
The-the guy who plays
Jon Snow was a jerk.

11
00:00:23,883 --> 00:00:25,353
(Raj:)We still watch
Game of Thrones.

12
00:00:25,351 --> 00:00:28,021
(Leonard:)He was a jerk because
you rear-ended him.

13
00:00:28,988 --> 00:00:30,658
(Raj:)I was distracted.

14
00:00:30,657 --> 00:00:32,657
(Raj:)It's weird seeing a member
of the Night's Watch

15
00:00:32,659 --> 00:00:34,259
(Raj:)with a kayak strapped
to his car.

16
00:00:35,895 --> 00:00:36,895
(Raj:)Come on.

17
00:00:36,896 --> 00:00:37,966
(groans)

18
00:00:42,001 --> 00:00:43,801
KOOTHRAPPALI: Hi,
excuse me, s-s...

19
00:00:43,803 --> 00:00:45,133
I-I don't mean
to bother you,

20
00:00:45,138 --> 00:00:47,468
(Raj:)but we're just really
big fans of Firefly.

21
00:00:47,474 --> 00:00:49,044
A-And Dr. Horrible.

22
00:00:49,042 --> 00:00:50,972
(Nathan Fillion:)Oh, uh, I think
you made a mistake.

23
00:00:50,977 --> 00:00:52,307
(Nathan Fillion:)I'm not an actor.

24
00:00:52,312 --> 00:00:54,642
(Raj:)Don't say that.

25
00:00:54,647 --> 00:00:56,147
(Raj:)I mean, you're not
Dame Judi Dench,

26
00:00:56,149 --> 00:01:01,019
(Raj:)but you're
pretty great.

